<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exhĭbĭtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		exhibeo (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A handing out</i>, <i>giving up</i>,
				<i>producing</i>, <i>delivering</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabularum testamenti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					29, 3, 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chirographi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					14, 2, 7</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			(Acc. to exhibeo, I. B. 2.) <i>Sustenance</i>, <i>maintenance</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 26,
				2, 26 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">27, 2, 3</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Idol. 6</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
